{"id":"vod_sn_37019","vodId":"37019","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"冰上的尤里","name_cn":"冰上的尤里","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0331919f1d9c6792d8a4b71afc82228c.jpg"},"summary":"胜生勇利（丰永利行 配音）是一名花样滑冰选手，在挑战赛中失利的他赶回了故乡九州，不知道自己一片迷惘的前途该何去何从。就在此时，一位名叫维克托（诹访部顺一 配音）的花滑教练出现在了勇利的面前，他曾是世界选手赛中连续五届称霸的王者，亦是勇利从小就憧憬的对象。　　维克托的出现改写了勇利的未来，与此同时，样貌与品行严重不符的俄罗斯少年尤里（内山昂辉 配音）亦出现在了勇利的身边。在维克托的帮助下，勇利重新找回了对花滑的信心和热爱。乐观温柔的埃米尔（日野聪 配音）、沉默寡言却实力强大的奥塔别克（细谷佳正 配音）、内向羞涩的季光虹（本城雄太郎 配音），这些个性迥异的选手们和勇利一起活跃在赛场之中！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:48:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G6uXr79HAW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KzaDJgECEH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p1wPape9PB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aQkuEjH5Ma1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/xNiRfVhr1Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Pq6Vzp8XXv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1DuUvyFPDk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Uv1NpA1mnj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/qYQLRv2DJP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1zpc5Mjhvk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jXT6d1fk3f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ZpF4zFZaeR1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:16.100Z"}